	quest.1C0AADC12D28BE24.quest_desc: [
		"Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks gives you a spellbook full of ready-made spells, from fireballs to summoning. Spells come as scrolls you slot into your book."
		""
		"§eThe path:§r get a spellbook, put scrolls in it at the Inscription Table, find better scrolls in loot and craft them with ink at the Scroll Forge. Later, craft school armor and fight the big bosses. Grab a few books first."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 3 x Book and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1C0AADC12D28BE24.title: "Spells and Scrolls"
